<title>USA: Idaho $25 mln repriced, 2027 yield cut to 5.45 pct.</title>
<headline>Idaho $25 mln repriced, 2027 yield cut to 5.45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced Idaho Housing and Finance Association's $25 million mortgage bond deal, cutting the yield in 2027 to 5.45 percent from 5.50 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>IDAHO HOUSING AND FINANCE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000*</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE BONDS</p>
<p>1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>NOTE PRICE CHANGE FOR THE 2027 MATURITY ONLY.</p>
<p>NO ADDITIONAL ORDERS WILL BE TAKEN.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT WILL BE CLOSED.</p>
<p>					    21,250,000*</p>
<p>					    SENIOR BONDS</p>
